{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_08_end","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_08","title":"旷古之晤","storyCode":"WB-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"d848cc630d895cc64ba26d726920e9d401e2252092542b16fcb0bfcddf56c750","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"天灾终于来临。截云在城外恩师坟前拔出了那把剑，某人的计划也因此得逞。城楼上，林雨霞看到抵抗天灾力竭倒地的父亲，终于认清了自己的责任。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"尚在那一片混沌鸿蒙之中，我见过两个顽童大打出手，只为争抢捡来的一颗果子。\n两人年纪相仿，身材相仿。只是其中一个反应更快些，抡起的拳头也更沉些，就将对手打倒在地。\n果子当然也就成了他的战利品。\n胜者欢欣，败者垂泪。\n我也见过那场围猎。\n人类向不可企及的“祂们”宣战。渺小的个体战胜了连仰视都目不能及的神明，伏尸百万，流血漂橹。\n胜者生存，败者消亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"“武”到底是什么？\n力量？技巧？杀敌之术？\n一个人力量再强，赢不过千军万马，敌不过高速战舰。\n可若暗杀偷袭都算技巧，杀人也可以无所不用其极。又何必将其当作一门学问？\n关隘难过，为了寻求一个答案，我舍弃了力量，将“自己”封印入剑，塑造出一副人的身躯。\n有多久了？\n有多久没有遇到过这样一个对手，可以让自己不为求索，尽力挥拳？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第八合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"面对抢攻，宗师只是撤了一步。槐天裴的拳在挨到宗师手掌边缘时便已势尽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撑拔骨骼的声音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"习武四十余年，我从未见过高山，也未尝一败。\n拜的第一位师父教了我半年，摆摆手说已经没有东西可教，让我另找名师。\n在那之后，又陆续拜了几位师父，每一位都只教了一年半载就将我逐出师门。\n世上武功门派数以百计，可人无非双手双脚，哪来那么多花招套路。\n我要练我自己的武功。\n让拳头更重，脚步更快，眼神更准。\n可是眼前的这个人......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第九合......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"槐天裴重拳直取宗师身侧，封住其身法退路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"宗师未动，同出重拳，截槐天裴拳势之半而击之......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胜负应该已经很清楚了......这世上有谁可以受对面这人九拳？\n他有一种错觉，如果自己是石头，那正面对的不是一块更大的石头，而是，一汪深深的潭水。\n潭底已经积满了石头。\n人习“武”，哪能胜过“武”本身？\n可自己还在这里站着。\n槐天裴的双脚陷进了沙里，他站稳，凝心定气，深深地吐纳。\n良久，他重新拉开了拳架。\n移山岳可以填湖川。如果不能将寒潭填平，那只能说明石头还不够大！不够重！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血的声音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我输了。\n我输了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第......十合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"录武官停下了手中的笔。\n他不知道，到底该怎样记录这一拳。\n只是极其简单的对招。两人从出拳到相击到分开，没有任何形意变化，像是孩童为了抢夺吃食出全力冲撞。\n只不过，他们抢夺的，是“胜”。\n他从未见过，老师的脸上闪过忍痛的神情。\n起风了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宗师胜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血的声音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下看起来的确是没有将胜负放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会不在意胜负？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实是天下第一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我练了四十年，就能胜过你一拳。那我再练三百六十年，就能彻底胜过你！那时我就是天下第一！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是再练三百年，我恐怕的确不是你的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可世上真有普通人能达到如此长的寿命吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确有些人依托源石技艺来延长寿命，年逾三百的例子并不是没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，槐先生应该不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不等三百年，你也已经是人间第一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师......槐先生已经晕过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先将他送回军营疗伤吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（此起彼伏的叫好）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（击打刀鞘的声响）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵，那个人，是你的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以你观之，那把剑能否托付给他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"论武功人品，再无其他人可以胜任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯觉得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"左宣辽没有说话。他看着城楼下的战场，双方一倒一立，胜负已分。\n但将士们仍在以刀击鞘，这是长久以来，玉门军中观看演武时特有的助威形式。\n的确是场难得一见的对决，战场广阔，飞沙走石，生死相搏。\n病弱的将军都觉得隐隐血热。\n曾有多少次，自己和他并肩作战，无论面对怎样的敌人，也不过如这般奋力向前。\n如果有一个地方，他可以托付这把剑，那也应该是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"师父，我回来了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女一步一顿，走向了移动城市航道旁的一处土丘。\n坟茔新起不久，旁边有几株对角分布的胡杨，是她专门选的记号。所幸与自己估算的距离差得不多，城市没有驶出太远。\n她躬下身，将剑放在坟头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父，我说过，我会将这把剑带回来，我做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去了那家工坊，见了那个刀匠，也看到了那棵老槐树......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"移动城市里面的样子，和我想象的大不相同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样一个地方，是不是就能算“家”呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"为什么人们生活在会移动的巨大地块上，却一点都不担心害怕？\n不害怕天灾摧毁房屋，不害怕找不到水源和食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我有些不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白移动城市里的人，甚至不明白离开移动城市的您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不明白，他，到底是一个怎样的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他英勇、强大、不可战胜。\n他愚钝、可悲、不容于世。\n你拿着他的剑，你离他很近。\n......\n声音很遥远，是谁在向自己搭话吗？\n她突然想看看，这到底是怎样的一把剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会在明天出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近期边境安稳，我离开一阵子，应该也没事。"},{"type":"narration","text":"这么着急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......还有另外一些兄弟的伤病，都等不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门找不到可以医治的医生，不代表炎国找不到。就算在炎国找不到，这片大地又何其辽阔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一个弟弟，或许他就有这本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我回来之前......你要保重。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你又不是医生，怎么这么霸道。也不问问病人自己想做什么？\n哪怕我已经时日无多，剩下的时间，我也想去别的地方看看。\n在玉门待了这么久，眼睛里都是这望不到头的黄沙。不如趁我还骑得动驮兽的时候，再到处走走。\n去尚蜀看看闻名遐迩的三山十八峰，去江南尝尝刚采的脆生生的菱角......\n最好，能有个人陪着我一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病人不能太任性......"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是你怎么会懂病人的心思。其实你从来都不会生病，甚至不会受伤，对吗？\n不只如此，我们认识了这么久，你脸颊上一道皱纹都没有添过。\n我们，是不一样的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就出发。你别想那么多，好好休息......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......梦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拔出剑来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i07"},{"type":"narration","text":"古剑出鞘。\n只是普通的剑，除了造型奇怪了些，甚至都不锋利。\n透过那几寸剑身，她看到了天际的云，和被云遮住的日影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"原来这就是你将自己与祂分离的秘密。\n理所当然，甚至无趣。\n你才是变得最像“人”的那一个。\n一缕残魂悄然离去。\n他已经得到了答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父，我该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把剑还回去......我还要，亲自问问他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令小姐，您怎么睡在瓮城顶上！天灾马上就来了，赶紧下来避险吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里就交给我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玉门四卫已经升起，瓮城滤沙结构和源石净化工事也已全部启动，它们会成为玉门第一道也是最牢固的那道屏障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但从前方云团的规模来看，玉门四卫并不足以将风暴全部拦下来，越过屏风卫的沙尘和源石粉尘将形成二次风暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"估计，仍相当于一场小型天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"百姓迁出后，关联城东的全部地块已经下沉躲避冲击。但核心内城的地块是固定的，它们会直面二次风暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"驻守玉门的钦天监术师，共十二人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何分工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"六人在此坚守，六人保护核心内城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"内城，六人够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯有令，两处都不得有失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......钦天监当尽全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都去核心内城吧，这里交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是一样危险，别啰嗦。去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一回看到类似的景象，还是几十年前刚到尚蜀的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门没有湖松和归行那样清冽的佳酿，但烈刀子也是好酒。天呀，你又用这样的景色招待我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也应该再敬你一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜呀，可惜今儿个手边无盏可掷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i08"},{"type":"narration","text":"一声惊雷像是突然在耳边炸响，压住所有人的心跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只一瞬间，黑云压城。\n层层叠叠的气团硬生生把天空拖垮，来回穿梭的弧形闪电像是狰狞的活物。\n雨滴在凝聚的瞬间便已蒸发，空气干燥得似乎稍有摩擦便会燃烧起来。\n玉门城便是那枚火石。\n天地只此一景，何等夸张，何等可怖，又是何等壮观！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来得好！"},{"type":"narration","text":"身侧的提灯应声而亮，诗人起身，解开葫芦满饮——\n百丈狂沙吹雨，咫尺惊雷连云。\n当年掷盏飞残暮，今宵抔酒对高城。\n天地入瓮瓶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"功率已经开始重新调高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再高！让沙渠维持在满功率运转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是在玉门城移速最高的时候，沙渠的排沙压力也没这么大。现在城市静止，单单满功率运转沙渠，没有联动装置分担，机械损耗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顾不上那么多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果屏风卫挡下的沙土和源石浮尘全堆积在前面，以这个量，玉门的基座会被“吃掉”，如果陷死，之后就麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕，你们要先考虑考虑自己的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这天，是彻底变了脸呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荆先生？不是组织大家都到城西避灾吗，你们怎么还没走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那帮山海众的*玉门行话*，趁着混乱，到处破坏天灾工事，骚扰老百姓，刚刚被我们撞见了好几次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是巡防营的工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是天灾又是山海众，巡防营应付得过来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说这种时候躲起来，我们还对得起腰上挂的这口刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算，算我一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔贡兄弟，你只是来玉门旅游的，犯不着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎国话说，“滴水之恩，涌泉相报”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总不能，白白让大家请我喝了那么多酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好小子，有志气。行，也算你一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了。没保护好玉门，左宣辽才会治你的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是新酿的烈刀子！坊主说过，要请你们喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟老先生他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多的不必说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要知道他是死在这群*玉门行话*手里的就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贪婪的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些玉门佬，都要逃命了，还是没忘记把家当搬得干干净净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贪婪的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过这条街还有好几家玉石铺子，总不至于连石头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是穷惯了，看见财物就晃了眼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那一队已经去捣毁沙渠了，别忘了我们的任务是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贪婪的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没忘没忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贪婪的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过他们已经有所准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一群二十年没真动过刀，只能靠打擂台发泄的老粗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乌合之众。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么，一群流寇匪徒出身的家伙，顶着这么有文化的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌合之众。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的目的是到处流窜，尽可能制造混乱，别让他们跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再分出一拨人，截断旁边的康庆街，康庆街通向城西，百姓们都在那儿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝完酒，一起杀贼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来的时候不觉得，往回走怎么......这么远......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风沙也越来越......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好。足迹没有完全被抹平......找到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确是在返回玉门，你没有骗我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来拿回剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也来确保你平安无事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么......也伤得这么重？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及说了，要赶紧回到城里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你运气很好，跳下沙渠竟然没有丧命。但这身伤，恐怕要治疗很久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我扶你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能是我看错了。这个时候，沙漠里怎么可能会有别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门城完全停止行进，与预计地点稍有偏差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾主体已经触及玉门东城，暂时无法与魏公取得联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......登城。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"路断何妨豪兴，岁老但问归心。\n一夕春寒催铁甲，万点秋霜洒玉门。\n长梦悲古今。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"令小姐真是，好气势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看得我这只老鼠都有些技痒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这帮家伙，是想关停沙渠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们清楚沙渠在此刻的重要性......山海众里居然还有精通机械构造的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（冷哼声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是要自己转身跳下去，还是待会儿我把你们的尸体抛下去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说左乐来过这里，想着来帮帮忙。看来我到得刚刚好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山海众曾经向姜齐的水寨发出过邀请，可惜还没收到回复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你现在居然和炎国官军站在一起，未免太可笑了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的消息，很灵通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。我们一直在关注着同路人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啰嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道忘了自己来玉门，是为了报仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好问题，可惜我已经有答案了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剑客重新举起了手中的武器。\n这一击，她不再有收剑的理由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"来自萨尔贡的男人劈出一刀，击退了偷袭守军的山海众成员。\n他的炎国话不标准，但这一刀利落潇洒又威力极大，颇有返璞归真的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好快的刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好家伙，原来你之前在客栈不是吹的，你是真有两下子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，没两下子，我就这一下子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位宗师当年游历到萨尔贡，确实教过我，但只教了这一招......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砍了他们这么多人，这帮家伙还不退，也真是不怕死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是风暴撞在屏风卫上的动静，大家小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的震感，比以往玉门经历的任何一次天灾都要来得强烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢想直面天灾的钦天监术师们怎么样了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在是天灾最猛烈的时候，他们疲于应付，我们别在这里耗着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海众成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快点解决这些人，然后往城西的居民避难点撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贪婪的山海众成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闹了就想溜？早就猜到你们要往这个方向冲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当兵的，快把他们围起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荆先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾有钦天监术师们收拾，那这帮臭*玉门行话*就由咱们收拾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"天裂了个口子，数不清的沙砾和石块在旋涡中摩擦、翻滚、碰撞，竟然发出金属般的刺耳声响。\n风暴旋转着直冲到城楼，而后撞上了一堵由源石技艺组成的墙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"挡住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重新列阵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的冲击力，真的只是越过屏风卫后的二次风暴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"林先生，您怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"来搭把手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里有我们在，您老人家回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"回哪儿去？这样的动静，未必老人家还能安心在房间里睡午觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"内城的源石净化装置能勉强吸附源石浮尘不至于扩散，但尘暴本身的冲击，只能靠术师们的源石技艺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"多个人，多份力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林说着话，迈步向前。\n他不知道什么时候脱下了外套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"操弄了几十年的沙子，要是这种时候再派不上一点用场，我这把老骨头还真不如就地埋了算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，各位天师嫌弃我这点法术不够用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......林先生小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"变阵！给林先生让个位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸！我追了你一路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞，你来得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才刚刚受过伤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"会碍事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看好了，源石技艺，你还有的是东西要学。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风暴在半空重新聚拢，转瞬再至。最外围的土石杂屑无序旋转，风暴的中心，空气被压缩到极致，隐隐有火星迸射。\n天地作长吼，随后在下一瞬间突然静音——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"平地起黄沙。沙粒填补了源石技艺墙的每一寸缝隙，推着它缓慢但是稳稳地向前，一米......三米......十米！\n林站在术师们中间。再大的风也吹不动百年的树。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i09_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我等从未见过这样的沙石法术......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全力施展，能将辐射范围扩大到这样的程度，还如此稳定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当心，又来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞其实没有见过父亲全力施展源石技艺的样子。他处理敌人，从来用不着大张旗鼓。\n作为龙门的影子，他的生活很有规律——\n在大街小巷“闲逛”，喝一碗鳞丸汤，见一些人，活着的，死了的。\n多数时间谈笑风生，能让他龇牙咧嘴的事情，已然不多。\n可此刻脱了那件外套，他的背影看上去瘦小得有些夸张。林雨霞清楚地看见他施术的手臂开始打颤，像是随时会被风吹折的，枯枝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"扶林先生下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"四波源石尘暴，林先生在法阵中心，分担了大半的冲击，已经吃不消了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血的声音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"唉......\n“但愿这次能早些了事，不耽误你去维多利亚的行程。”\n“没见过另一条路，就不能算自己的选择。”\n爸总是说这样的话。\n林雨霞该走什么样的路，不希望父亲来安排，可能她自己也还没有想好。\n但爸他，其实早就老了，那句经常挂在嘴边的“退休”不是开开玩笑。\n上阵父女，老一辈的倒下来，小一辈的就得顶上去。\n从来都是这么个不讲道理的道理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i09_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞上前了一步，将受伤的父亲挡在身后，顶替了他的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"钦天监术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姑娘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别多说，你们都受了伤，调整呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就这几波了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看前面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
